/** @mainpage Qore Ssh Module

    @tableofcontents

    @section sshintro Ssh Module Introduction

    The Ssh module provides server-side SSH and SFTP support for Qore through
    <a href="https://www.libssh.org/">libssh</a>. The module is designed for
    controlled command processing, auditable file transfer, and integration
    scenarios.

    Key capabilities:
    - typed server-side SSH and SFTP contracts in
      @ref Qore::Ssh "Qore::Ssh"
    - live SSH command and SFTP server flows through
      @ref Qore::Ssh::SshServer "SshServer"
    - full SFTP protocol support including symlink, readlink, setstat, and the
      @c statvfs\@openssh.com extension
    - configurable cipher, KEX, MAC, and host-key algorithm restrictions with
      per-listener IP allow/deny CIDR filtering
    - multi-factor / partial authentication with configurable required methods
    - server-side keepalive probes, idle session timeouts, and pre-auth banners
    - active session enumeration and SFTP read-ahead pipelining
    - generic @c ConnectionProvider and @c DataProvider infrastructure
    - virtual filesystem persistence with snapshot and write-through modes
    - strongly typed virtual SFTP helper, backend, and provider APIs
    - helper/service logger support through @c Qore::Logger::LoggerInterface
    - SSH key management through @ref Qore::Ssh::SshKey "SshKey" with key
      generation, import/export, inspection, and comparison

    @section sshnavigation Documentation

    - @subpage sshgettingstarted -- quick-start examples for SFTP and command servers
    - @subpage sshauthguide -- authentication methods, multi-factor auth, and providers
    - @subpage sshsftpbackendguide -- SFTP backend types, custom backends, and persistence
    - @subpage sshkeymanagement -- SSH key generation, import, export, and inspection
    - @subpage sshcookbook -- complete typed code examples for common scenarios
    - @subpage sshtypedcontracts -- typed hash reference index grouped by domain
    - @subpage sshreleasenotes -- version history

    @section sshusermodules User Modules

    - @ref sshserverconnectionsintro "SshServerConnections" -- @c ConnectionProvider
      helpers for managed local SSH/SFTP server instances; registers the
      @c sshsrv, @c sshserver, @c sftpsrv, and @c sftpserver connection schemes;
      provides grouped
      @ref sshserverconnections-sshserverconnectionlimits "limits",
      @ref sshserverconnections-sshserverconnectionservices "services", and
      @ref sshserverconnections-sshserverconnectionsecurity "security" options
    - @ref sshserverauthproviderintro "SshServerAuthProvider" -- config-driven
      and custom object-driven authentication for @c none, @c password,
      @c publickey, @c interactive, @c hostbased, and @c gssapi-mic methods
    - @ref sshservercommandproviderintro "SshServerCommandProvider" -- virtual
      command-service helpers with policy, audit, and concurrency controls
    - @ref sftpserverdataproviderintro "SftpServerDataProvider" -- virtual SFTP
      filesystem, exchange, and record-store helpers with @c DataProvider
      integration, inbound policy enforcement, and observable events

    @section sshquicklinks Quick Links

    - @ref Qore::Ssh::SshServer "SshServer class reference"
